    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθημοσύνη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>advice, counsel,
			warning,</i> in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθημοσύνῃσιν Ἀθήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.412
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.233
			</span></i>: also in later 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1146
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Afric.
				<u>Cest.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, etc.: sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμοῦ ὑποθημοσύνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.3.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Astr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
